ZONE 2 — THE LAST SCALAR DIRECTIONAL-INTRA KERNEL — IN NEON LANES, WITHOUT
C's GATHER. 1.4 % AT THE STILL ARM'S WORST CELL, 2.5-4.2 % ON THE VIDEO KEY
FRAME AT p6.

